OL,3,ACall to review sentence for driver who
OL,4,Akilled boy
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP says she has written to the
OL,7,Fattorney general seeking a review of
OL,8,Fthe sentence given to a speeding driver
OL,9,Fwho killed a 12-year-old boy and fled
OL,10,Fto Latvia.
OL,12,FOn Friday, Aleksanders Dolars, 23, was
OL,13,Fsentenced to nine years and four months
OL,14,Fin prison for causing the death of
OL,15,FKeaton Slater by dangerous driving in
OL,16,FCoventry in June 2024.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
