OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACall to review sentence for driver who
OL,4,Akilled boy
OL,5,
OL,6,FDolars evaded capture for Keaton's
OL,7,Fdeath for more than two years by
OL,8,Ffleeing to Latvia and he was finally
OL,9,Fbrought to justice following a
OL,10,Fdetermined campaign by Keaton's
OL,11,Fparents.
OL,13,FTheir MP, Taiwo Owatemi, has supported
OL,14,Fthem and has written to the attorney
OL,15,Fgeneral to suggest the sentence is
OL,16,Freviewed and ask whether a life
OL,17,Fsentence might have been appropriate.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
